flowchart TD
    A[Receive two order snapshots] --> B{Both snapshots valid?}
    B -- No --> X[Invalid input / human review]
    B -- Yes --> C{Order IDs match?}
    C -- No --> Y[Stop comparison / human review]
    C -- Yes --> D[Compare status, total, currency, item count]
    D --> E{Any discrepancies?}
    E -- No --> F[Report MATCH]
    E -- Yes --> G[Report every field-level mismatch]
    G --> H{Any HIGH severity mismatch?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Require human review]
    H -- No --> J[Report MEDIUM discrepancy]
    F --> K[No source data changed]
    I --> K
    J --> K
